[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2819570389","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105605#issuecomment-2819570389","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105605","id":2819570389,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oDzrV","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T21:48:06Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T21:58:06Z","body":"In my testing, using `debug_symbols=yes generate_android_binaries=yes` seems to work: the native symbols are generated in a separate ZIP file with the `.dbg`'s inside.\r\n\r\nHowever, adding `do_not_strip_android_so=yes` doesn't seem to be working. I would have expected that to leave the debug symbols embedded in the `libgodot_android.so` for use with local debugging, but I can tell by the file sizes that that's not the case.\r\n\r\nMy `bin/libgodot.android.template_debug.arm64.so` is 855M, but if I extract the `android_sources.zip` and the contained `.aar` file, the `libgodot_android.so` inside is only 73M.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2819570389/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820794554","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105605#issuecomment-2820794554","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105605","id":2820794554,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oIei6","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T09:52:45Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T09:52:45Z","body":"> Adding `do_not_strip_android_so=yes` also works as expected, generated android editor (arm64) apk size is `328.6 mb`.\r\n\r\nHave you tested building export templates with `do_not_strip_android_so=yes`? That's what's not working for me, and I'd be curious if that's working for you as well. If so, then I guess I did something wrong? I didn't test using it with an editor build.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820794554/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820948125","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105605#issuecomment-2820948125","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105605","id":2820948125,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oJECd","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T10:56:03Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T10:56:03Z","body":"I tested and can reproduce the issue pointed out by @dsnopek.\r\n\r\nWith:\r\n```\r\nscons p=android arch=arm64 target=template_debug debug_symbols=yes do_not_strip_android_so=yes generate_android_binaries=yes\r\n```\r\n\r\nI get:\r\n```\r\n$ lsmb bin\r\ntotal 1994108\r\n-rw-r--r--. 1 akien akien  242.33MB Apr 22 12:37 android_debug.apk\r\n-rw-r--r--. 1 akien akien   23.14MB Apr 22 12:37 android_source.zip\r\n-rw-r--r--. 1 akien akien   23.25MB Apr 22 12:37 godot-lib.template_debug.aar\r\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 akien akien  850.84MB Apr 22 12:36 libgodot.android.template_debug.arm64.so\r\n```\r\n\r\nNotably, there's no `native-debug-symbols` in `platform/android/java/app/build/outputs/`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820948125/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2821122745","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105605#issuecomment-2821122745","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105605","id":2821122745,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oJuq5","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T12:08:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T12:08:33Z","body":"> > Adding `do_not_strip_android_so=yes` also works as expected, generated android editor (arm64) apk size is `328.6 mb`.\r\n> \r\n> Have you tested building export templates with `do_not_strip_android_so=yes`? That's what's not working for me, and I'd be curious if that's working for you as well. If so, then I guess I did something wrong? I didn't test using it with an editor build.\r\n\r\nI tried building the template and encountered the same issue. While the `android_debug.apk` is generated with debug symbols, the `android_source.zip` does not include them, so Gradle builds projects would not include debug symbols.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2821122745/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2821776982","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105605#issuecomment-2821776982","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105605","id":2821776982,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oMOZW","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T15:55:38Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T15:55:38Z","body":"> Notably, there's no `native-debug-symbols` in `platform/android/java/app/build/outputs/`.\r\n\r\n@akien-mga That's the intended behavior. When `do_not_strip_android_so=yes` is included, the `native-debug-symbols` file is not generated because the debug symbols are included in the `so` packaged in the apk. That's the reason why the `android_debug.apk` in your screenshot is `240+ Mb` for a single arch, ~250Mb is the usual size for all arches when their `so` are stripped.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2821776982/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822699571","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105605#issuecomment-2822699571","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105605","id":2822699571,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oPvoz","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T23:28:56Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T23:28:56Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822699571/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822756257","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105605#issuecomment-2822756257","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105605","id":2822756257,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oP9eh","user":{"login":"Summersay415","id":71974498,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTc0NDk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71974498?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415","html_url":"https://github.com/Summersay415","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T00:13:33Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T00:13:33Z","body":"Any reason to use `do_not_strip_android_so` instead of `separate_debug_symbols`? Right now the latter is only used on PC platforms","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822756257/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822798610","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105605#issuecomment-2822798610","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105605","id":2822798610,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oQH0S","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T00:52:46Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T00:52:46Z","body":"I only found `separate_debug_symbols` here in the documentation. Android doesn't use this flag. [sources](https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Agodotengine%2Fgodot%20separate_debug_symbols&type=code)\r\n\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.html#debugging-symbols\r\n\r\n>When using debug_symbols=yes, you can also use separate_debug_symbols=yes to put debug information in a separate file with a .debug suffix. This allows distributing both files independently. Note that on Windows, when compiling with MSVC, debugging information is always written to a separate .pdb file regardless of separate_debug_symbols.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822798610/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822820370","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105605#issuecomment-2822820370","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105605","id":2822820370,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oQNIS","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T01:12:21Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T01:12:21Z","body":"> Any reason to use `do_not_strip_android_so` instead of `separate_debug_symbols`? Right now the latter is only used on PC platforms\r\n\r\n@Summersay415 I went with an Android specific parameter because I wanted to highlight that the debug symbols file generation is tied to the `gradle` build process, so if you were to run the command without including `generate_android_binaries=yes`, no debug symbols file would be generated.\r\n\r\nThat said, I don't have objections with using `separate_debug_symbols` instead if we think that'd be more consistent.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822820370/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822856511","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105605#issuecomment-2822856511","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105605","id":2822856511,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oQV8_","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T01:46:32Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T01:46:32Z","body":"@Summersay415 I've opened https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105671 to discuss which parameter to use.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","rea